It is evening.
I am finally finished with work.
It is January and it is very cold.
I am walking home.
I am very hungry.
I see a food stand on the street.
A man works there.
He asks: "What will you have?"
I answer: "I will take a Currywurst, please."
The man asks: "With fries?"
I say: "No thank you, just the sausage."
The man makes the Currywurst.
He says: "That comes to three euros fifty, please."
I give the man four euros.
He gives me fifty cents back.
I say thank you.
I stand at the counter and eat the Currywurst.
I now have an address and a mobile number.
